flowchart TD
    title Inventory Management Flow

    A[Stock Check Request] --> B{Check Type?}
    B -->|Single Product| C[Query Stock Level]
    B -->|Bulk Check| D[Query Multiple Stocks]
    C --> E{In Stock?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Return Available Qty]
    E -->|No| G[Return Zero]
    D --> H[Return Stock Map]

    I[Reserve Stock] --> J{Reserve Items}
    J --> K[Check Each Item]
    K --> L{All Available?}
    L -->|No| M[Release Previous Reservations]
    M --> N[Return Failure]
    L -->|Yes| O[Create Reservation]
    O --> P[Set Expiry Timer]
    P --> Q[Return Reservation ID]

    R[Confirm Reservation] --> S[Convert to Sale]
    S --> T[Decrement Stock]
    T --> U[Cancel Expiry Timer]
    U --> V[Return Success]

    W[Release Reservation] --> X[Cancel Expiry Timer]
    X --> Y[Restore Stock Levels]
    Y --> Z[Return Released]

    AA[Low Stock Alert] --> AB{Below Threshold?}
    AB -->|Yes| AC[Send Alert Email]
    AB -->|No| AD[No Action]
